            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "seed",
            "docs": [
              "Seed u64 de las PDA seeds (varios escrows por maker). (offset 112, 8 bytes)"
            ],
            "type": "u64"
          },
          {
            "name": "bump",
            "docs": [
              "Bump de la PDA `EscrowState`. (offset 120, 1 byte — siempre al final)"
            ],
            "type": "u8"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
